     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "David spends $1,835.03 on necessary expenses, which is fairly close to the 50-30-20 budget philosophy guidelines. He spends $471.98 on expenses that are wants, which is well below the guideline of $1,035. He has $1,149.99 in extra income, which is well above the savings and debt service guidelines."
